Null-input docs committed 9d936aa. Added an actual pinned Java 5.5.1 unstarted runtime oracle: two subscriptions, one null topic and one named topic, both reach getTopicRouteInfoFromNameServer; two requests, no server contact. Pinned request header with null topic omits its ext field in makeCustomHeaderToNet. Route fixture SHA-256 928aecaaffa4b27a6070d69eebbe5b16dd378cb9661b7f79d62f27b24dfb459f. Extended native socket regression expects the corresponding absent topic field and observed red exit101 because native route union currently skips null. Preparing independent oracle/red commit before targeted null route request correction.
Null-topic route request oracle/red committed b57594c. Added nullable route API emission: null subscription topic participates in the union and emits GET_ROUTEINFO_BY_TOPIC with no topic ext field; rejected/missing route responses continue to other topics like Java's caught client exception. Successful route response fails before cache publication with typed InvalidRoute, matching invoked Java NullPointerException branch. Extended unstarted Java fixture to record that outcome. Fixture SHA-256 a8c6be7d5fb98f4a660f15835dfea6c74c03464c63d958c48f0d5c8c227a4b1d. Both focused local-socket regressions pass; full socket-enabled cargo test --workspace --all-targets --locked, strict all-target/all-feature Clippy, pinned Maven -o verify, cargo fmt, diff check, comparator self-test and 22-scenario manifest pass. Preparing independent implementation/test/log commit; broader Phase6 audit remains open.
