Extended pinned `checkClientInBroker` runtime oracle with a non-TAG subscription whose topic is null. Actual Java throws NullPointerException before route lookup or broker RPC; fixture SHA-256 73990a351770ca0d8451590eef16bc3931115f90853193f37f3e4e18d61c841d. Native already returns typed InvalidRoute without RPC; added focused regression. Initial test failed because the weakly registered owner was not retained; retaining the owner made it pass. Maven verify and focused socket-free test pass. Preparing independent oracle/test/log commit; no production change warranted.
