Extended the custom-equality fixture with actual Java `containsValue` calls for equal-but-distinct producer and consumer owners; both return true. Client-config fixture SHA-256 da5f62a870b8f188b50ba92f70de9d3a2872767e8241fb9e798604c479934795. Added `ProducerTable/ConsumerTable::contains_value`, comparing captured equality keys or Arc identity without owner callbacks under the registry lock. The focused native regression was red before the method (exit101), then passes. Preparing independent implementation/oracle commit; full mutable view behavior remains open.
