Pinned Java 5.5.1 live-view oracle extended in RuntimeConfigFixtures: retained producer/consumer keySet, values and entrySet handles observe direct put/repopulation; each view removes mappings and clear empties the backing map. All nine outcomes pass for each map. Updated client-config fixture SHA-256 8e2e8041b64bac3e8e6708d79c8c786635ddf8166ed128fefe4303f0bdfe8ee5; pinned offline Maven verify passes. Preparing independent oracle/fixture commit before adding Rust view handles.
Added native retained-view integration regression against the new Java oracle. Red compile confirms ProducerTable and ConsumerTable lack key-set, values and entry-set view handle APIs (exit101). The regression checks retained handles observe direct puts/repopulation, key/value/entry removal and clear. Preparing independent red-test commit.
Extended pinned Java custom-equality oracle: producer/consumer values.remove and entrySet.contains/remove all accept equal-but-distinct owner proxies. Fixture SHA-256 6ca2b11853282852407ab476bbd2e4b41401aa4cbe816b2d68ee35d0efa801a8. Native live-view implementation is in progress; this adds behavior evidence only.
Native registry regressions now exercise the Java custom-equality view oracle: values-view remove and entry-set contains/remove for producer and consumer tables. Both this focused equality test and the live-view mutation test pass against the pinned fixture. Preparing separate test commit; production view code remains uncommitted until full gates.
Implemented cloneable live registry view handles for producer/consumer tables: key-set, values and entry-set query/length/emptiness/snapshot/remove/clear operations. Retained handles follow the backing table; entry checks and values/entry removals use the table's captured Java-equality key, while key removal and clear preserve direct map mutation behavior. Added registry table_contains_entry under the registry lock without running owner callbacks there. Native tests match the nine Java retained-view operations for both tables and Java equals-based values.remove/entrySet.contains/remove for both owner types. Gates pass: full socket-enabled cargo test --workspace --all-targets --locked, strict all-target/all-feature Clippy, pinned offline Maven verify, fmt/diff, comparator self-test and 22-scenario manifest. Fixture SHA-256 6ca2b11853282852407ab476bbd2e4b41401aa4cbe816b2d68ee35d0efa801a8. Java live iterator/bulk-view operations, mutable equals, getOrDefault and broader source/input audits remain open. Preparing implementation commit.
Documented registry view parity in ADR-0009, the Phase 6 API map and requirement audit. These now record cloneable live handles with contains/length/emptiness/snapshot/remove/clear, fixture evidence and explicit remaining Java iterator/bulk, getOrDefault and dynamic-equality gaps. Phase 6 remains incomplete. Current client-config fixture SHA-256 6ca2b11853282852407ab476bbd2e4b41401aa4cbe816b2d68ee35d0efa801a8; workspace tests, strict Clippy, pinned Maven, fmt/diff and comparator/manifest22 pass. Preparing separate documentation commit.
Extended pinned Java 5.5.1 table default-operation fixture for `getOrDefault` present/absent and `putAll` insertion on both producer and consumer ConcurrentMaps. Both Java map cases report true; final fixture key/value snapshots include putAll additions. Pinned offline Maven verify passes. Client-config fixture SHA-256 d0c7f7bec5dd54c6570419099cc4d9ba7dd2d94a53baa5a84cdabcc43e8ae01d. Preparing oracle-only commit before native regressions.
Added native regression cases for invoked Java ConcurrentMap `getOrDefault` and `putAll` on both producer and consumer tables. Compile-red confirms both methods are missing on both public table types (exit101). Preparing independent red-test commit before implementation.
Implemented the remaining invoked ConcurrentMap helper methods on ProducerTable/ConsumerTable: `get_or_default` preserves the current Arc when present, and `put_all` applies owned entries as independent per-key writes. Native default-operation test now matches Java present/absent reference outcomes, putAll additions, and final snapshots. Fixture SHA-256 d0c7f7bec5dd54c6570419099cc4d9ba7dd2d94a53baa5a84cdabcc43e8ae01d; pinned Maven verify passed. Full socket-enabled workspace tests, strict Clippy, fmt/diff and comparator/manifest22 pass. Java view iterator/bulk operations and wider source/input audit remain open. Preparing implementation commit.
